# Physics stage 8, step 4c: do blood decals draw, and how they age. A pool laid by hand at its real
# size on Onar's field (earth) at 06:00, seen at noon (6 h old) and at 18:00 next to a fresh one.
seed 73015
cheat god
set time 6 0
release all
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
wait 500
clear 3000
blood NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02 pool 45
hold back 900
hold right 900
wait 1500
set time 12 0
cam follow 200 230 200
wait 5000
shot aged-6h-noon
blood_stains sample
wait 1000
set time 18 0
wait 5000
shot aged-12h-evening
wait 1000
hold left 1500
wait 1500
blood NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02 pool 45
wait 3000
shot fresh-evening
blood_stains sample
wait 2000
quit
